  "description": "From a young age, I've always dreamed of being that “unassuming hero,” appearing ordinary but possessing unmatched strength. But one day, fate took a turn when I was hit by an eight-ton truck, and suddenly, reincarnation was on the table! \"What would you like to be in your next life?\" asked the goddess of reincarnation. Eagerly, I replied, \"I wish to become a wimp, but secretly OP!” She granted my wish, but with an unexpected twist: if anyone ever uncovers my true abilities, my heart will explode! This isn't quite the “secretly-OP-wimp-life” I had in mind… \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
